---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Practical HR advice for small business owners, from Coast HR.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p>Practical, no-nonsense HR advice for small business owners — from real situations Deanne has worked through with her clients.</p>

    <div class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <div class="post-card">
        <p class="post__date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read more &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
